# --- U_CUT4
U_CUT4.1  /VSCAP  # ADR-129 D5 / ADR-047 s2.1 (cut 4 drive from raw supercap, PRE-LDO)
U_CUT4.2  GND  # ADR-129 D5 / ADR-051 s2.5 (cut 4 return)
